  <p>Schedules and requirements at temples change, so always check directly with the centre before you travel.</p>

  <h2>How 347 Awakening teaches Vipassana</h2>
  <p>At the Silver Temple, Master Kaie blends Vipassana-based meditation with <strong>inner coaching</strong>. You learn the technique, and you also learn how to use it with stress, overthinking, emotions and life decisions. Sessions include sitting, walking and lying meditation, and every step is explained in English.</p>
  <p>The practice follows the <a href="/method">347 Method</a>: align Body, Mind and Spirit; awaken through Morality, Mindfulness, Meditation and Wisdom; and carry the change into seven areas of life.</p>
